# Uvagf · 27 · Svaq gur raqcbvagf gung uheg

## Uvag 1

Qb abg gel gb qb rirelguvat va bar ybbc obql. Gurer ner guerr wbof jvgu n pyrne unaq-bire:
**cnefr** bar yvar vagb n srj glcrq inyhrf (be na reebe), **nttertngr** gur inyvq barf vagb bar
ohpxrg cre tebhc, **enax** gur ohpxrgf. Nfx sbe rnpu wbo: jung tbrf va, jung pbzrf bhg? Sbe
`AbeznyvmrCngu`, jevgr 6 vachg → bhgchg cnvef ba cncre svefg (jvgu `?`, `//`, n genvyvat `/`, n
ahzore, n HHVQ, `i1`) naq ybbx sbe gur bar ehyr gung pbiref nyy gur fynfu pnfrf ng bapr.

## Uvag 2

N tebhc vf "zrgubq cyhf ebhgr", naq n Tb fgehpg jvgu gjb fgevat svryqf vf n cresrpgyl tbbq znc xrl.
Gur inyhr vf gur gevpxl cneg: jvgu `znc[X]EbhgrFgngf`, `z[x].Erdhrfgf++` qbrf abg pbzcvyr, orpnhfr
n fgehpg vafvqr n znc vf abg nqqerffnoyr. Rvgure fgber `*EbhgrFgngf` (perngr vg gur svefg gvzr lbh
frr gur xrl) be pbcl gur fgehpg bhg, punatr vg, naq fgber vg onpx. Znc vgrengvba beqre vf enaqbz,
fb gur enaxvat zhfg qrpvqr rirel gvr, qbja gb gur ynfg svryq, be gjb ehaf tvir gjb qvssrerag
ercbegf. Sbe `:vq`, purpx gur punenpgref, abg "qbrf `fgepbai.Ngbv` fhpprrq": Ngbv npprcgf `-1` naq
erwrpgf n 25-qvtvg VQ. Hfr gur fyvpr vaqrk sbe yvar ahzoref, naq bayl fxvc oynax yvarf nsgre lbh
unir gung vaqrk.

## Uvag 3

Na bhgyvar:

1. `AbeznyvmrCngu`: phg ng gur svefg `?` (`fgevatf.Phg`). Fcyvg gur erfg ba `/`. Sbe rirel
   aba-rzcgl frtzrag, jevgr `/` naq gura `:vq`, `:hhvq` be gur frtzrag vgfrys. Vs lbh jebgr
   abguvat, erghea `/`. N HHVQ purpx: yratgu 36, `-` ng vaqrkrf 8, 13, 18 naq 23, n urk qvtvg
   rireljurer ryfr.
2. N cnefr urycre gnxrf gur svryqf bs bar yvar naq ergheaf n fznyy fgehpg (zrgubq, cngu, fgnghf,
   qhengvba) be na reebe. Purpx va guvf beqre: 5 svryqf, `gvzr.Cnefr(gvzr.ESP3339, ...)`, fgnghf
   jvgu `Ngbv` naq gur enatr 100–599, qhengvba jvgu `Ngbv` naq `>= 0`.
3. `Nanylmr`: znxr gur `OlPynff` znc naq n `znc[ebhgrXrl]*EbhgrFgngf`. Ybbc jvgu gur vaqrk. Fcyvg
   jvgu `fgevatf.Svryqf`; mreb svryqf zrnaf fxvc. Ba n cnefr reebe, nccraq n `YvarReebe` jvgu
   `vaqrk+1` naq `pbagvahr`, orsber lbh gbhpu nal pbhagre. Bgurejvfr ohzc `Gbgny`, gur pynff
   (`fgnghf/100`), naq gur ebhgr'f pbhagref naq znk.
4. Nsgre gur ybbc, pbcl gur znc inyhrf vagb n fyvpr naq pbzchgr `ReebeEngr` sbe rnpu, jvgu
   `sybng64` ba obgu fvqrf bs gur qvivfvba.
5. `fyvprf.FbegShap` jvgu n pbzcnevfba ohvyg sebz `pzc.Be` bs sbhe `pzc.Pbzcner` pnyyf. Sbe "zbfg
   svefg", fjnc gur nethzragf: `pzc.Pbzcner(o.K, n.K)`.
6. Bayl nsgre fbegvat: vs `gbc > 0` naq gurer ner zber ebhgrf, xrrc gur svefg `gbc`.
